# checksums.sha256 — expected SHA-256 digests for the pinned Phase 254 bootstrap
# artifacts (D-12, T-254-01). Machine-readable by `sha256sum -c`: every
# non-comment line is "<64-hex>  <staged-filename>". The staged filenames are
# exactly the names scripts/k8s/lib/artifacts.sh downloads into its private
# temporary directory before any execution or extraction.
#
# Sources (re-fetched and diffed against 254-RESEARCH.md on 2026-08-30; see
# 254-03-SUMMARY.md verification log for the per-value diff):
#   k3s-installer.sh            https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k3s-io/k3s/v1.36.4+k3s1/install.sh
#   k3s-server-amd64            https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/download/v1.36.4+k3s1/sha256sum-amd64.txt
#   k3s-server-arm64            https://github.com/k3s-io/k3s/releases/download/v1.36.4+k3s1/sha256sum-arm64.txt
#   helm-v4.2.4-linux-*.tar.gz  https://get.helm.sh/helm-v4.2.4-linux-<arch>.tar.gz.sha256sum
#   cert-manager-keyring.gpg    https://cert-manager.io/public-keys/cert-manager-keyring-2021-09-20-1020CF3C033D4F35BAE1C19E1226061C665DF13E.gpg
#                               (official cert-manager Maintainers signing key, fingerprint
#                               1020CF3C033D4F35BAE1C19E1226061C665DF13E; re-fetched and pinned
#                               2026-09-02 per the Phase 259 pin rule — digest must be updated
#                               in the same reviewed commit as CERT_MANAGER_VERSION)
#   prometheus-community-pubkey.gpg  https://prometheus-community.github.io/helm-charts/pubkey.gpg
#                               (official prometheus-community Helm chart signing key, fingerprint
#                               27252B168248743B; re-fetched and pinned 2026-09-03 per the Phase 261
#                               pin rule — digest must be updated in the same reviewed commit as
#                               KUBE_PROMETHEUS_STACK_VERSION)
#   grafana-community-pubkey.gpg  https://grafana-community.github.io/helm-charts/pubkey.gpg
#                               (official grafana-community Helm chart signing key, fingerprint
#                               84275654C470636BB88BDCD1C0EA64E52D7A0D41; re-fetched and pinned
#                               2026-10-06 per the Phase 301 pin rule — digest must be updated in
#                               the same reviewed commit as LOKI_CHART_VERSION)
#   alloy-1.13.0.tgz            https://github.com/grafana/helm-charts/releases/download/alloy-1.13.0/alloy-1.13.0.tgz
#                               (grafana/alloy Helm chart 1.13.0 — UNSIGNED, no .prov asset. Per D-11
#                               the SHA-256 digest is the PRIMARY/only verified path for this chart,
#                               not a fallback; re-fetched and pinned 2026-10-06 — digest must be
#                               updated in the same reviewed commit as ALLOY_CHART_VERSION)
#
# Pins change only through a reviewed repository update (D-10).
